      "title": {
        "en": "Respected and committed veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients speak with deep gratitude about Dr. Joey Vasquez and his staff, describing them as honest, humble, and hardworking veterinary professionals who truly love animals. Longtime clients emphasize that the team goes above and beyond to provide essential pet care. A few negative reviews mention being turned away for advanced conditions, but overall sentiment is very high."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable surgery and preventive treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise successful spay and neuter surgeries, small incisions, rapid pet recoveries, and routine vaccinations. Many pet parents note that clinical care has kept multiple family generations of dogs and cats healthy. While isolated reviews express disappointment when pets with terminal conditions could not be treated, most report dependable outcomes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Early queues for walk-in slots"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Wait times are a central theme across reviews. Because the clinic operates on high demand with affordable walk-in services, clients advise arriving early in the morning—often at dawn—to reserve a place on the daily intake list. Several pet parents note lengthy multi-hour waiting periods before being seen, though most agree the quality and low cost make the wait worthwhile."
      }
    }
  ],
